The bug is in `lookup`: the search skipped any context whose property was `null` or `undefined`, so `pedido.cupom: null` fell through to the global `view.cupom`.
It now stops at the first context that has the property (own or inherited), using `in`.
I also fixed standalone lines: a lone `\r` at the end of the template no longer counts as a line break.

